              <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE [My manager effectively collaborates across boundaries (e.g., team, organizational, has a strong partnership with the product ma (tech!responses!19-01-241)]&#10;WHEN &apos;Strongly Disagree&apos; THEN 1 &#13;&#10;WHEN &apos;Somewhat disagree&apos; THEN 2&#13;&#10;WHEN &apos;Neither agree nor disagree&apos; THEN 3&#13;&#10;WHEN &apos;Somewhat agree&apos; THEN 4&#13;&#10;WHEN &apos;Strongly agree&apos; THEN 5&#13;&#10;END' />
