            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#787878'>Avg. Reward Driver from Peakon&apos;s latest survey. Data is shown on average and not NPS since extraction of data per manager and amount of promoters, passives and detractors is not possible. Weighted average using the average score and size of each segment is used.</run>
